     1	"""Unit tests for debate-converge.py CLI + compute_convergence API.
     2	
     3	PLAN-011 Phase 5 (M1 anti-groupthink gate). Tests cover:
     4	
     5	- Jaccard arithmetic (symmetry, identity, empty sets, disjoint sets)
     6	- Threshold boundary at 0.7
     7	- Normalization: ID prefix stripping, punctuation, whitespace
     8	- Red-team flag semantics (red_team_needed iff converged AND round <= 2)
     9	- Fixture-based end-to-end for converged / not-converged / partial-overlap
