   461	    """The exact death the finding describes, end-to-end: TARGET_BASE moved to
   462	    the next MINOR, tree at the previous one. Before the fix the phase wrote
   463	    ten sites and then DIED at its own verify-counts call ("a site is
   464	    unpatched") — this asserts it reaches its commit with a clean tree."""
   465	    repo, env = synth["repo"], synth["env"]
   466	    drv = repo / ".claude/scripts/local/release.sh"
