    54	# PLAN-081 Phase 2 — Pair-Rail dispatcher mode.
    55	#   --pair-mode             Activate Pair-Rail routing via .claude/dispatcher/
    56	#                           routing-matrix.yaml. Looks up archetype's coder+
    57	#                           reviewer providers + sandbox + fallback policy.
    58	#                           Emits `## PAIR-RAIL DISPATCH` header instructing
    59	#                           caller to dispatch coder via primary rail and
    60	#                           pair the reviewer provider via PostToolUse hook.
    61	#   --coder=<provider>      Override the matrix-resolved coder provider.
    62	#                           Honored only when --pair-mode is active.
    63	#   --reviewer=<provider>   Override the matrix-resolved reviewer provider.
    64	#                           Honored only when --pair-mode is active.
    65	#
    66	# Resolution precedence (highest first):
    67	#   1. CEO_PAIR_RAIL_DISABLE=1   (kill-switch — forces single-LLM Claude)
    68	#   2. --pair-mode flag absent   (legacy single-rail path; no dispatcher
    69	#                                consultation; no dispatcher_route)
    70	#   3. disable_predicate fired   (matrix's predicates evaluated;
    71	#                                 fallback_provider engaged)
    72	#   4. --coder= / --reviewer=    (Owner override; emitted as reason_code
    73	#                                  override_<arg>)
    74	#   5. matrix archetype entry    (default coder+reviewer per spec.md §10)
